From 2183b3461d2009906fbd72df5724f9bf5f9c24ae Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: boyfromcave <57612331+boyfromcave@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 17:07:58 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add the three Ycash testnet profiles

testnet-yb-fast stays the Zcash-testnet re-fork and verifies blocks above
its partial checkpoint list. testnet-yb-slow and testnet-legacy are shadow
forks of mainnet through height 3,079,999, selected as TestnetSlow and
TestnetLegacy, with ycash6's magics, ports, genesis, upgrades, PoW reset,
checkpoints, and Yellowback columns.
